  "prefLabel": "Sw 217.05 Decision on Motion for Rehearing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 217.05 Decision on Motion for Rehearing. The hearings officer shall grant or deny a motion for rehearing, or suspend the order or decision pending further consideration within 10 days of the filing of the motion for rehearing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Sw 200) #12093, eff 1-27-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw200.html"
